<title>USA: Case expands board by adding two directors.</title>
<headline>Case expands board by adding two directors.</headline>
<dateline>RACINE, Wis. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Case Corp said Wednesday it expanded its board to 10 by adding two new directors.</p>
<p>Elected were Pei-yuan Chia, former vice chairman of Citicorp and Citibank N.A. and Thomas Hodgson, president and chief operating officer of Abbott Laboratories Inc.</p>
<p>Case designs, manufactures and distributes agricultural and construction equipment.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
